{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_jesica_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_jesica_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "緩步前行",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_jesica_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6766baaad33d18d4a60476ad0854b67f265b203bcddf33b2fc3b774e114fdc62",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗯，我是一次就學會了，你大哥也是。\n但是沒關係，你年紀最小，現在當然沒辦法做得像我們一樣好啦。\n我們慢慢來，一次不行就兩次，一天不行就兩天。\n只要最後學會就好啦，快一點慢一點又有什麼關係呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "報告......！最後一箱蝕刻子彈完成入庫，設備與物資已經全部歸位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "收到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，你真要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "欸？嗯，是的，抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，新兵通過培訓考核可不容易，你剛加入黑鋼，不應該正是意氣風發、準備拼搏一番的時候嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且你可是那個耶蘭德教出來的新人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "但是我只是勉勉強強通過考核......耶蘭德教官對我也......呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "新人嘛，總不能想著任何事情都一蹴而就。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼這麼堅定地要離開黑鋼？是之前出任務受傷讓你覺得害怕了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "不，當時那只是點小傷......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉，好吧。各人都有私事，你為難的話我就不多問了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才測試的防爆盾牌，你覺得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "啊？嗯......應該是採用了雷神工業最新研發的材料，感覺對各類投擲物都能有效防護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "但是整體有些重......啊，對、對不起，我應該每天多做兩組力量訓練的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對於菲林而言，它的設計確實有些笨重，你的判斷一如既往地很準確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "辛苦你了，潔西卡。多虧你扛著它完成全部測試，我們才能獲得這麼多資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "沒、沒事的，這是我的工作......最後一次工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，可惜了這麼好的測試員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我還不夠好，對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......我該去人事部了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，好吧。後會有期，潔西卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "請問，潔西卡在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "測試負責人",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "潔西卡？她剛離開，應該是去人事部了吧。您找她有事的話，我見到她可以幫忙傳個話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "沒事，我自己去找她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（應該是在這裡等吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......多謝，與黑鋼的技術合作一直都是雷神工業最重要的一部分業務，我們尤其感激您在其中的推動，“橋夾”先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼內環成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，那都是多少年前的事情了。再說了，除了雷神工業，我想也很難有其他軍火供應商的技術實力能滿足黑鋼的需求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這倒是。直到現在，蝕刻子彈的設計與改良都仍然是我們的研發重點之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下個季度訂單對接時，期待還能與您進行如此輕鬆的會面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼內環成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，那我這邊就先告辭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼內環成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，你要去找他的小女兒......布林雷應該還好吧？替我向他致以問候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，多謝您的關心，我會向布林雷先生傳達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您好，“潔西卡”小姐，我是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "瑞、瑞蒙先生，您好，我當然記得您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "請不要對我這麼客氣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，不愧是布林雷的千金，果然很有頭腦，也不擺架子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣？您在這裡過得還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "嗯......黑鋼的訓練方式很嚴謹，我感覺自己正在不斷進步。當然，與合格的雇傭兵相比，我還差得很遠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來您也覺得不虛此行，那真是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您和您父親應該有兩年沒見了吧，布林雷先生一直盼著您回家呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "離職手續都辦理妥當了吧？您的行李在哪裡？我叫人去把它們搬上運輸載具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "瑞蒙先生，等、等一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什麼事？您說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "您上次來的時候只說，父親希望我回家......但如果我在黑鋼國際找到了自己的道路，我也可以留在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "所以我想知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是這樣，布林雷先生當初很認可您的野心，同意您加入黑鋼，拓寬自己的視野，開創自己的事業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上一次他得知您的才能在黑鋼被埋沒，雖然感到惋惜，但仍然給了您三個月的時間來決定是否繼續留在黑鋼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......我明白，我的表現還是不夠得到父親的認可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "對不起，我確實努力過了，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，潔西卡小姐，這些話我可能已經說過數次了，但還是希望您聽一聽。您的父親認為您應該回家，是出於多方面的考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您現在就職於裝備與應用技術部門，對於黑鋼來說，這充分發揮了您的出身賦予您的優勢，但對於您自己來說，這不可不謂是大材小用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "您知道我並非什麼人才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您在黑鋼所能接觸到的最新設備，也不過是雷神工業經過無數次內部測驗產出的成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您既然對這一方面有興趣，想要有所作為，為什麼不回到雷神工業大展拳腳呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更何況，這可是您家族的企業啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在您父親身邊，您一定會有足夠的資源和充分自我發揮的空間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不必從普通的裝備測試員開始打拼，也不會像現在這樣，長時間得不到重視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看您現在的處境，這多不像一個布林雷家的孩子啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "對、對不起......是我太沒用了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，潔西卡小姐，請您不要這樣妄自菲薄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，聽說您在最近的外勤任務中受了傷，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "嗯，是我自己訓練不夠到位，實戰中過於緊張......對不起，我還要多加磨煉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來如此。您看，雇傭兵這一職業終究是有生命風險的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使訓練方式再怎麼嚴謹，您也可能受傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也有一個小女兒，因此格外理解布林雷先生是如何愛女心切，還請您不要見怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布林雷先生當然鼓勵他的孩子們自己外出闖蕩，如果您能像您的姐姐那樣獨自幹出一番事業的話，他也十分欣賞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但您畢竟是最小的孩子，布林雷先生還是希望您能參照過來人的經驗，少吃一些苦頭，少走一些彎路，趁早回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和您的哥哥姐姐們相比，您不那麼擅長跟人交際，也並未鑽研過機械設計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要靠身體素質和戰鬥本領打出一片天地，對您來說也還有些困難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "您說得對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "對不起，瑞蒙先生......我總是讓您和父親失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有的事。還有，您回去之後雷神工業也可以為您量身打造一套裝備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您如果有更優良的防護裝備，在那種小規模衝突裡本來是不會出事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "可是就算有最好的裝備......我又能拿它們去做什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要您喜歡擺弄這些凝聚了設計師心血的產品就好，不必特意考慮要拿它們去做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，巴倫基地位置偏遠，您在這裡還能吃到金牌廚師製作的點心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得前幾年您來辦公室的時候，布林雷先生特地囑咐我訂了一桌茶點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "這個......訓練期間伙食控制很嚴格......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "雖然我也會買一點零食......嗚，要是我能更自律就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請別苛責自己，我認為您已經很努力了，潔西卡小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我向您訓練期間的教官耶蘭德先生詢問過，他對您似乎沒有太多印象，只提到您訓練時很刻苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "連耶蘭德這樣赫赫有名的精銳傭兵都認為您的表現無可指摘。雖然您沒有特別驚人的表現，但您的努力訓練幫助您勉強通過了考核。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您又有什麼可自責的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "耶蘭德教官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "對不起......我想到他就有點緊張......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，這正是布林雷先生擔憂的事情。您在這裡經歷了許多痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過我很高興看到您忍受了下來。您已經得到了充分的歷練，磨礪了優秀的品格，如今再回到家族，想必......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "——抱、抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我的離職流程還沒有結束......而且，在離開之前，我還想......跟我的朋友們告別一下。可以再給我一點時間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，這恐怕會打亂日程，您的父親在等著您回家呢......不過當然啦，以您的安排為主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "好、好的，對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我現在就去人事部......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......呼......哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......荒地的風。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無人的室外訓練場一角，潔西卡閉上眼睛，用力地呼吸著帶有源石火藥味道的空氣。\n為了通過淘汰率近八成的新兵考核，她默默在這裡消耗了無數休息時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（這片沒有盡頭的大地，我算見識過了嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（......不算吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（只是參與了幾場小規模衝突的處理，除此之外的時間，都待在基地裡訓練、測試。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩年前，她前所未有地鼓起勇氣，為了自己即將邁出的下一步而去和父親對話。\n家裡已經給她選定了進修的學校和專業，也為她規劃好了畢業之後的工作，但她想給黑鋼國際投遞履歷。\n她對父親說，她還不知道自己能做好什麼事情，所以還想進一步磨煉自己。\n而且，父親總說這片大地沒有盡頭，人們的生活也有無數種可能性。\n所以她想去見識別人的生活，找到自己的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（不過，行李早就收拾好了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（要告別的人......好像也沒有。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "對不起......我什麼都沒能做到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "......你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "啊、啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "真對不起！我、我只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "稍等，別跑啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我來自B.P.R.S.部門，代號“雷蛇”......你是，潔西卡，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "是！您、您好......雷蛇前輩......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我正在找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "你部門同事說你去訓練場了，訓練場那邊的工作人員又說沒見過你。還好我路過室外測試場地時看了一眼，恰好看到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我希望能跟你本人溝通一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "由於我個人職務變動，我現在需要一名副手。在篩選了黑鋼的人才資料庫檔案之後，我比較希望你能夠來擔任這個職位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "好、好的......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "您的意思是......擔任您的副手？我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "嗯。我需要有優秀綜合能力的人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "可是我不覺得自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "除了資料庫中的考核資料，我對你的能力水準不算很瞭解。不過我和約瑟夫聊了一下，他也認為你很適合這個職位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "約瑟夫......耶蘭德教官？他明明說自己對我沒什麼印象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "嗯？不，前兩天我們正好有空一起吃飯，他覺得你會是個很好的副手，跟我做事的風格很搭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "他說，你也是那種，覺得自己絕對不可能通過黑鋼的選拔測試，但還是天天跑訓練場的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "......你還好嗎？你看起來很痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "抱、抱歉......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我其實已經準備離開黑鋼了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "......不甘心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "你看起來很留戀這片訓練場。為什麼要走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......因為我做得不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "你的槍退還回去了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "還，還沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "那就拔槍，讓我看看。就當是實戰演習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "在、在這裡？可是這裡沒有防護......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "不用擔心，我有盾。再說，你在實戰訓練裡對約瑟夫發起的攻擊，有哪一次沒被他化解嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......那，那不好意思了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "不錯，成功擊發，射擊精度合格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "但是子彈威力......很有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "別緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "眼神也不要閃躲。盯好你的對手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "好反應，訓練形成的條件反射很到位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "但是實戰的情況永遠比訓練複雜得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "嗚啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "對，對不起......我沒能躲開......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "已經合格了，你不瞭解我的源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "來，起來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我真的......合格了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "嗯。我沒覺得你像你說的那樣，“做得不好”。你只是見得還不夠多，練習也還不夠，但新人都是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "見得還不夠多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......雷蛇前輩，我可以向您請教一個問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "嗯？雖然我會要求你訓練，但我並不是一個好教官......算了，你想問什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "您是......怎麼發現自己適合做雇傭兵的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "適合？我不知道自己適不適合，我只是想成為雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是如果不適合呢？您不害怕走彎路嗎？\n——或者，也許人們的生活並不應該被簡單規定成，挑選一條最便捷的路，然後走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......謝謝。謝謝您對我的認可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她握緊了拳頭，像那天站在父親辦公室門前的時候一樣。\n這是黑鋼傭兵“潔西卡”自己的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......我想從您那裡獲得這次機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "嗯，好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "但是我要向你事先說清楚，我所在的B.P.R.S.是一個十分特殊的部門......它不夠核心，而且工作總是非常危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "和感染生物打交道，處理急性源石污染事件，你應該明白這其中的風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我、我知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "通常任務中，大部分傷口都可以完全恢復；但在B.P.R.S.的任務中，較嚴重的傷口意味著你可能會感染礦石病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我看過你的完整檔案記錄，知道你上一次任務時就受了輕傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "當然，B.P.R.S.會配備最完善的防護措施，珍妮特主任也一直致力於優化部門的緊急事件應對措施，降低感染風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "而且，如果你成為我的副手，我也會更加嚴格地要求你進行訓練。在你完全達到我的期望之前，我不會讓你參與高度危險的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "情況就是這樣。我在發起部門間調動申請之前來找你，正是想給你選擇權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "謝謝您......但是我已經決定好了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我還想繼續增長見識，接受更嚴格的訓練......然後，找到一些問題的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "不，不是關於我自己的問題，是關於其他人的生活......我在任務過程中見到了一些事情，但是現在我還很困惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "這樣嗎？抱歉，我這裡可能沒辦法直接給你答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "但是我很高興我的副手也會思考這樣的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "您的副手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "你是不是要去人事部處理離職的事項？我和你一起去吧，這樣撤銷申請容易一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "啊，好、好的......謝謝您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "可是瑞蒙先生那邊，我該對父親說什麼才好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡小姐，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "呃......您怎麼在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在黑鋼內部不方便四處走動，所以我就到外面來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "似乎您剛剛說要撤銷離職申請？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "雷蛇前輩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "......不，沒事。對不起，瑞蒙先生，我不打算回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "請......轉告父親，“潔西卡”無論如何都想留在黑鋼國際，作為安保公司的雇傭兵，保護一些人，解決一些問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "我還沒有找到自己的“可能性”是什麼......但我願意繼續找下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷神工業代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_222",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會轉告他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的小女兒還是想繼續當黑鋼國際的“潔西卡”？......這股執著勁才像布林雷家的孩子。\n也難為你對她說那麼多風涼話了。但我需要知道她意志足夠堅定，不會被扔到一個地方就隨波逐流。\n是啊，我當然也不想讓她吃苦。這片大地上的困苦實在太多，她會有很多疑問，卻很難找到答案。\n但既然她想當一個挑戰者，就讓她去當吧。就算她會是家裡最後一個明白自己該做什麼的孩子......或者永遠不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
